#: ../../../flagos_homepage/chip_adaptation_guide/_shared/05_compatibility_certification/index.md:2
msgid "FlagOS Compatibility Certification System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../flagos_homepage/chip_adaptation_guide/_shared/05_compatibility_certification/index.md:4
msgid ""
"Following the Android CDD/CTS design, FlagOS has established a tiered "
"certification system. Based on further discussion, certification objects "
"are divided into three layers: chips, complete systems, and software"
"/cloud-native platforms, covering different vendor forms and later "
"showroom, policy, and procurement scenarios."
msgstr ""

